  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Having a curve for a property that changes across all the child bones of a physbone is great if you have like twelve children.  But sometimes you just have three or four, and having to set each of their values by adding keys to a curve and sliding until you think they're all in the right place, is a lot more awkward than just moving individual sliders (or textfields) for each child bone would be.  It would be nice if there were an option to just set the values manually instead of using the curve interface.",
